  "goodToKnow": "Parlamentarisch means parliamentary: eine parlamentarische Demokratie, die parlamentarische Arbeit, der parlamentarische Staatssekretär (junior minister). Germany is a parlamentarische Demokratie: the Bundestag elects the chancellor, and the government depends on its majority. Der Parlamentarier is a member of parliament, formally der Abgeordnete. The Reichstag building in Berlin, with its glass dome, is the seat of the Bundestag."
